[38;2;124;124;124mHmm, let me reconsider. The finiteness of the Tate-Shafarevich group for abelian[0m[38;2;124;124;124mvarieties over function fields is itself a deep result. In the function field [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mcase, this was proved by... [0m

[38;2;124;124;124mActually, I think the story is:[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m1. Tate proved that for abelian varieties over function fields, the BSD rank [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mformula holds (analytic rank = algebraic rank). This used his theory of the [0m
