[38;2;124;124;124mfields.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m3. More recently, Kato and Trihan (2003) proved BSD for abelian varieties over [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mfunction fields of curves over finite fields under more general conditions.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mSo the answer to the question is: Yes, the BSD conjecture is known (is a [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mtheorem) in positive characteristic, i.e., for elliptic curves (and more [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mgenerally abelian varieties) over global function fields (function fields of [0m
