[38;2;124;124;124mLet me structure this:[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m1. State what "positive characteristic" means here: global fields of [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mcharacteristic p, i.e., function fields of smooth projective curves over finite [0m[38;2;124;124;124mfields F_q.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m2. State the analog: For an elliptic curve E over a global function field K = [0m
